; Every close of an account after its first is a duplicate, also when the
; first closed an account never opened: the close on line 6 is the
; first and an error of its own, the one on line 13 its duplicate, which
; still closes the account the open on line 8 made active.
2020-01-01 open Equity:E
2020-01-05 close Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2024-01-02 * "the account is active"
  Assets:Cash  1 USD
  Equity:E
2024-01-03 close Assets:Cash

2024-01-04 * "and closed again"
  Assets:Cash  1 USD
  Equity:E
